# Go. Combine with dotfiles/common/gitignore and dotfiles/os-editor/gitignore.

# Compiled binaries. ⚠ A Go binary is often named after its directory and has
# no extension, so it looks like a directory in a listing and gets committed.
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out

/bin/
/vendor/

# Coverage
*.cover
coverage.txt
coverage.html

# Workspace files are per-machine.
go.work
go.work.sum

# ⛔ go.mod and go.sum ARE committed. go.sum is the integrity record; without
# it a build can silently resolve to different bytes.
